    <briefdescription>
<para>LowerIntrinsics - This pass rewrites calls to the llvm.gcread or llvm.gcwrite intrinsics, replacing them with simple loads and stores as directed by the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_g_c_strategy" kindref="compound">GCStrategy</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It also performs automatic root initialization and custom intrinsic lowering.</para>
<para>This pass requires <computeroutput><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_collector_metadata_analysis" kindref="compound">CollectorMetadataAnalysis</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
